{"title":"2016 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three schools each sent four students to a competition. The scores earned by nine of the students are given in the table below. The scores of the remaining three students are represented by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. The total score for any school is determined by adding the scores of the four students competing from the school.----\n<i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total scores for Schools A and B are the same. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the score for Student 4 at School B?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2016 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">part a</a>, the total score for School A was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>From the table, we can see that the total score for school B is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5d8af609c8d4c1841daa929d5917b2af88e4e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17 + 5 + 7 + x = x + 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"190\" height=\"15\" />. The two total scores for School A and B are the same, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/8/5d8965c5d8487b7a5f98fb86e9e069b335eb8a2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 29 = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/9/6a902cd2a161a61ebe9fd467621d02fe9c586fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 36 - 29 = \\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"140\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018002000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1139/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1257/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.396      1 2016_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%   14.396      1 -total\n 39.99%    5.757      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36953:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018002000 and revision id 285809. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}